[statement]
Of the removals left for last, those waiting on one go before it in the
order of apk's table of names (see `install-order/`), each at the first
of the names it carries and provides: `la` and `lb` both need `so:c`,
which `m` provides at a version, and `app`, removed first, needed them
through names they provide at a version. `lb` provides `so:b`, whose
bucket comes before those of `la`, `lb` and `so:a`, so apk removes `lb`,
then `la`, then `m`, though the database lists `la` first and `app`
states `so:a` first.

[repository]
P:x
V:1

[installed]
P:m
V:1
p:so:c=1

P:la
V:1
p:so:a=1
D:so:c

P:lb
V:1
p:so:b=1
D:so:c

P:app
V:1
D:so:a so:b

[request]
x

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove app 1
install x 1
remove lb 1
remove la 1
remove m 1
